<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-FORM-022" data-name="数量步进器" data-cat="FORM">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">数量步进器</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：购物车行内增减，到达上下限自动禁用，可长按连续增减</p>
  <div class="demo__stage">
